          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>It began with passion: a belief that the things we bring into our homes should be as pure as the intentions behind them.</p>"
          }
        },
        "p2": {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At Aurora, nothing is hidden. No chemicals, no synthetics, only what nature gives us. Cow dung, honoured for generations. Clove, our signature ingredient. Aromas drawn straight from the earth. What’s on our label is exactly what’s inside.</p>"
